<h2><a id="Presentació" name="Presentació"></a>Presentation <!--and options--></h2>

 <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpsopcions"/>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA editable de el WPS.--> 

<p>This application exports a point layer main table and add two fields to it,  MAPX and MAPY, which hold the X and Y coordenates. If there is a field  representing Z values, this is also exported.<br/>  
The main table may contain multiple records for each graphical object. It  may also records not linked to any graphical object. Multiple z coordinates  are also supported. It is also admitted that the main table (T.dbf) of the point layer of which we want to obtain the XY(Z) coordinates   is the destination table. In this case, the main table is enriched with the new MAPX, MAPY (, MAPZ) fields.<br/>  
If the main table contains the MAPX, MAPY and MAPZ fields, these are not  overwritten. Instead, additional fields with similar names are  created.<br/></p>

